sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Egyptian Customer
    participant App as Mobile App (Microphone)
    participant Speech as Speech Recognition (Whisper / Google)
    participant NLP as Egyptian Dialect Tokenizer
    participant Intent as Intent Resolver
    participant Catalog as Catalog Search Service
    participant Response as Audio & Text Response

    Customer->>App: "عايز لبن جهينه كامل الدسم" (Speaks Egyptian Arabic)
    App->>Speech: Stream PCM Audio
    Speech-->>App: Transcribed Text: "عايز لبن جهينه كامل الدسم"
    App->>NLP: POST /api/v1/ai/voice {query: text}
    NLP->>NLP: Strip stop-words, normalize vowels (أ -> ا, ة -> ه)
    NLP->>NLP: Expand synonyms: لبن -> [حليب, milk]
    NLP->>Intent: Pattern & semantic classification
    Intent-->>NLP: Intent: ADD_TO_CART (Confidence: 0.96)
    NLP->>Catalog: Grounded Query (tokens: ['جهين', 'حليب', 'كامل', 'الدسم'])
    Catalog-->>NLP: Matched: "جهينه حليب كامل الدسم - 200 مل" (11.50 EGP, In Stock)
    NLP->>Response: Formulate Arabic confirmation
    Response-->>App: "تم العثور على جهينه حليب كامل الدسم بسعر 11.50 جنيه. هل تريد إضافته للسلة؟"
    App->>Customer: Display product card & Play audio response
    Customer->>App: Tap "Confirm Add" -> Item added to cart
